    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Cohere is a for-profit startup founded in 2019 and headquartered in Toronto, Canada. According to its website, it builds models and AI solutions that enable enterprises to automate processes, empower employees, and turn fragmented data into actionable insights. The company describes tools for generative AI, advanced search, and multilingual capabilities that are built to keep an enterprise in full control, and it lists financial services, technology, and energy and utilities among the sectors it serves. The site also states that the team at Cohere has made foundational contributions to generative AI.\n\nIts tracked products are aimed at enterprise use. Cohere Coral is described as enterprise chat AI that is RAG-native with a focus on data privacy, from a Canadian vendor. Cohere API is an enterprise-focused large language model API, also positioned around data privacy, RAG optimization, and multi-language support. Cohere Command R+ is an enterprise RAG-optimized model with tool use, autonomous retrieval, and data grounding verification.\n\nThe record holds no litigation, no MCP servers, and no SEC or patent facts for the company.",
